      "VANCOUY\nTACOMA\nPASCO\nSPOKANg\nPORTLAND\nMEDFORD\nRENO\nSACRAMENTO\nO SAN JOSE\nFRESNO\nBAKERSFIELD\nLOS ANGELE\nSAN DIEGO\nBOISE\nELKO i\nAS VEGAS\n2 CENTRO\nTranscontinental \u0026 Western Air, Inc.\nStandard Air Line of the World\nTe Winnipeg!\nPEMBINA\nGRAND FORKS\n„GREAT FALLS\nHELENA\nBUTTE\nMÅNDAN\"\nBISMARCK\nTARGU\nTWA\nTHE\nLINDBERGH\nLINE\nMONTREMY BANGORO M\n3 AOROCKLAND\nSPORTLAND\nOSTON\nWATERTOWN\nPOCATELLO\nSIOUX FALL!\nST PAUL\nMINNEAPOLIS\nROCHESTER\nLACROSSE\nSIOUX CITY\nMADISON 9\nJANESVILLE-BELOIT.\nWAUKEE\nBUFFALS\nROGDEN\nSALT LAKE CİTY\nROCK SPRINGS\nCHEYENNE\nNEW YORK\nJATLANTIC CITI\nADELPHIA\nDES MOINES.\nIOWACITY\nMOLINE-\nFT.WAY\nLINCOLI\nCOLUMBUS\nDENVER\nINDIANAPDI\nTERRE HAUTE\nCOLORADO SPRINGS\nRUEBLO\nLOUISVILLEN\nWICHIT\nINGRED\nMEMPHIS\nPHOENIX\nWICHITA FALLS\n: BIRMINGHAM\nFORT WOR\nABILENE\nSANANGELO\nWACO\n• TEXARKANA\nSHREVEPORT\nMONROE\nJACKSON\nNASHVILLE\nÉ WINCH POINT OGREENSBORG\nORALEIĞH\nOCHARL\nCHATTANOOGA\nPEPARTANBURI\nGREENVILLE, \"OFLOREN\nTLANTA C\nCHARLESTON\nSMACON A\nSAVANNAH\nAORTGOMERY\nCKSONVILLE\nBEAUMONI\nHOUSTON\nAN ANTONIO\nTOBILE\nNEW ORLE ANS\nPILOTTOWN\n\\DAYTONA BEACH\nGALVESTON\n*\nORLANDO\nTAMP\nST.PETERSBURG\nBROWNS!\nTo Mexico City,\nLEGEND *\nRoutcs of T.W.A. Inc\nOther Air Mail Lines\n400\n200\n300 MILES\nAM PALMBE\nMIAMI\nTo Cuba. Central \u0026 South America\nWeather bureau and\nRadio center of TWA\nat the Kansas City base.\nInset, pilot aloft in radio\ncommunication with the\nground.\nWhenever Time Means Money Use the Air Mail\n8c first ounce or fraction thereof; 13c each additional ounce or\nFraction thereof; anywhere in the United States.\nUse any postage stamp. Mark envelope plainly \"Air Mail.\" Drop\nin any mail box.\nAir mail can be sent Registered, Insured, Special Delivery and C.O.D.\nAir Express\nThrough General Air Express, The Interline System, which includes\nTWA and other leading air lines, a nation-wide network provides\nfor the fast dispatch of commodities by air to the major cities in the\nUnited States.\nAir Express affords an ideal means for the rapid distribution of\nsamples, quick replenishment of stocks and the development of new\nmarkets. Store-door pickup and delivery is provided by the Postal\nTelegraph Company. Packages weighing up to 200 pounds will be\naccepted and shipment made on a collect or a prepaid basis.\nThrough way bills permit air shipments to move over the group of\nlines associated with TWA with a minimum of time in transit.\nCargo insurance, offering full protection is available at low rates.\nCall the nearest TWA, or Postal Telegraph office for rates and\ndetailed information."
